Package: parkeze-wireguard
Depends: parkeze-base, kmod-wireguard, wireguard-tools, ip-full, curl, ca-bundle, jsonfilter
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@parkeze.com>
Architecture: all
Description: WireGuard management tunnel, pinned to the wired path.
 Dials out to the parkeze.net WireGuard hub so gateway-link can reach this
 gateway's console and SSH directly. The keypair is generated on the gateway
 and its private half never leaves; the tunnel is confined to the ethernet WAN
 so that it can never run over metered cellular.
